{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は名古屋全国握手会でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"クリスマス前の握手会だから、やはりメリクリって言葉をよく聞いた1日だった。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生田氏と一緒でした❤"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生田氏はやはりおもしろい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なにがおもしろいかて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この私に体当たりしてくる。結構痛い。しかも握手会中に。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なかなか異色なペアだと思うでしょ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもこれがなかなかナイスなペアだったのよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"良い感じの具合でね。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/12/24/8168772/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うんうんうん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、これ別に人って漢字を表してるわけではないよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/12/24/8168772/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんかポーズしよってなって\nどうしよっか...とりあえず撮ってみようってなって撮ったらこんな感じ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生田能條はいいコンビです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあ私がうまい具合にいじられるだけなんですが。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と、いうわけで今日はなんの日ですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"クリスマスですよ、クリスマス。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ハッピーメリークリスマスです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年もあみのとこにサンタさん来てくれるのかし。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あぁ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サンタクロース。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あなたに会いたい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/12/24/8168772/0002.jpeg","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}